body:
Signed-off-by: Frost Ming <me@frostming.com>

## What does this PR address?

With this change, the following will be possible:

```python
import bentoml
from fastapi import FastAPI

app = FastAPI()


@app.get("/hello")
def hello():
    return {"Hello": "World"}


@bentoml.service
@bentoml.asgi_app(app, path="/")
class MyService:
    pass
```
Visiting `/` renders the swagger page, and visiting `/hello` gives the fastapi response. Previously, the app mounted at the root path `/` will shadow all internal endpoints

# schema: New schema for `real-estate.lease-agreement`

## Schema Action
New Schema

## Schema Motivation
Adding a schema for structured extraction of lease agreements, supporting both commercial and residential lease documents.

Benefits:
- Standardizes lease agreement data extraction
- Captures comprehensive lease terms and conditions
- Flexible structure for different lease types

## Sample Document
[Sample Commercial Lease Agreement](https://storage.googleapis.com/sample-hub-data/real-estate.lease-agreement/sample_lease_doc_6.pdf)

